{"html":"<section class=\"container-site ec-scenario-hero\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> / 家庭活动饮品服务</nav><p class=\"ec-scenario-kicker\">场景采购规划</p><h1>家庭活动饮品服务</h1><p>为家庭活动的非酒精饮品服务选杯。场景建议不代表已验证的适用年龄、儿童安全认证或耐热等级。</p><a class=\"ec-scenario-cta\" href=\"#scenario-models\">按产品类型查看型号 ↓</a><p class=\"ec-scenario-note\">先确定饮品、服务方式与使用环境，再审核型号、图稿、包装与样品。</p></section><section class=\"ec-scenario-index container-site\" id=\"scenario-models\"><p class=\"ec-scenario-kicker\">按型号继续比较</p><h2>此场景的参考型号</h2><p>共 13 款建议参考型号。展开产品类型查看；进入详情页核对选用理由与项目要求。</p><p class=\"ec-scenario-note\">这些是采购规划建议，不代表所有型号适用于相同饮品、温度或操作条件。</p><div class=\"ec-scenario-model-groups\"><details class=\"ec-scenario-model-group\"><summary>儿童杯 <span>(2)</span></summary><ul class=\"ec-scenario-model-list\"><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-8oz-kids-straw/\"><strong>GJB-012</strong><span>带吸管硅胶随行杯</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-8oz-kids-glow/\"><strong>GJB-022</strong><span>硅胶夜光杯</span></a></li></ul></details><details class=\"ec-scenario-model-group\"><summary>吸管 <span>(10)</span></summary><ul class=\"ec-scenario-model-list\"><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-sili-straw/\"><strong>GJXG-001</strong><span>硅胶吸管</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-long-straw/\"><strong>GJXG-002</strong><span>硅胶吸管</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/straight-silicone-straws/\"><strong>JBPJ-005</strong><span>硅胶直管吸管</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/colorful-silicone-straws/\"><strong>JBPJ-006</strong><span>弯折硅胶吸管</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/custom-silicone-straws-for-drinks/\"><strong>JBPJ-007</strong><span>定制硅胶吸管</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/diverse-styles-of-custom-silicone-straws/\"><strong>JBPJ-008</strong><span>带装饰的硅胶吸管</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-straw-sets-in-polybags/\"><strong>JBPJ-009</strong><span>硅胶吸管套装</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-straw-in-paper-box/\"><strong>JBPJ-010</strong><span>纸盒包装硅胶吸管</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-straws-in-window-box/\"><strong>JBPJ-011</strong><span>开窗盒包装硅胶吸管</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/glow-straws-for-light-drinks/\"><strong>JBPJ-094</strong><span>LED发光吸管（6色 · 25支装）</span></a></li></ul></details><details class=\"ec-scenario-model-group\"><summary>水瓶 <span>(1)</span></summary><ul class=\"ec-scenario-model-list\"><li><a href=\"/zh/products/hydaway-collapsible-water-bottle-gjzd012/\"><strong>GJZD-012</strong><span>Hydaway 折叠水壶 17oz</span></a></li></ul></details></div></section><section class=\"container-site ec-scenario-next\"><h2>准备场景项目询盘</h2><p>请提供型号、用途、数量、Logo与交付地点。饮品接触条件、清洁方式及配套部件按所选型号审核。</p><a class=\"ec-scenario-cta\" href=\"/zh/contact/\">提交项目需求 →</a><h2>比较其他场景</h2><div class=\"ec-scenario-related\"><a href=\"/zh/bar-hospitality-drinkware/\">酒吧与酒店餐饮服务 →</a><a href=\"/zh/tasting-events-drinkware/\">成人品鉴活动 →</a><a href=\"/zh/corporate-gifts/\">企业活动与品牌礼赠 →</a><a href=\"/zh/camping-drinkware/\">露营与便携饮品套装 →</a><a href=\"/zh/beach-party-cups/\">海滨活动饮品服务 →</a><a href=\"/zh/backyard-bbq-cups/\">烧烤与户外招待 →</a><a href=\"/zh/wedding-cups/\">婚礼与接待饮品服务 →</a><a href=\"/zh/open-air-nightclub/\">夜间场地活动 →</a><a href=\"/zh/holiday-party-cups/\">节庆活动项目 →</a><a href=\"/zh/tailgate-party-cups/\">比赛日招待活动 →</a></div></section>","kind":"page"}